(7223281, 1115096, 111808, '<td valign="top">I have no idea what really happened here from viewing your photograph, but it strikes me as sad and poignant. I love the shadow looking at the loss and how it is superimposed on the reflection, silent, waiting, perhaps remembering?  The tones in this are equally muted and dark all around adding much to the sense of emptiness. Very well done indeed.</td>', 'I have no idea what really happened here from viewing your photograph, but it strikes me as sad and poignant. I love the shadow looking at the loss and how it is superimposed on the reflection, silent, waiting, perhaps remembering?  The tones in this are equally muted and dark all around adding much to the sense of emptiness. Very well done indeed.', '2014-06-01 14:33:53.000000', NULL, 1),
