(7225521, 1115015, 83313, '<td valign="top">Is messuge left by grate ansestors. Grog canot read anshient <strike>hiroglifics</strike> <strike>heiragliffiks</strike> <strike>heiri</strike> pikchur-wurds, but thinks is kuopon for Karg''s spicy mammoth-que.</td>', 'Is messuge left by grate ansestors. Grog canot read anshient hiroglifics heiragliffiks heiri pikchur-wurds, but thinks is kuopon for Karg''s spicy mammoth-que.', '2014-06-07 14:28:44.000000', NULL, 1),
