(7225524, 1115160, 83313, '<td valign="top">I want to ride my bike here.</td>', 'I want to ride my bike here.', '2014-06-07 14:34:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7225525, 1113626, 83313, '<td valign="top">I expect the collective will not be terribly appreciative of this photo, but as a cyclist and a parent, it connects with me. When I taught my younger daughter to ride, she rolled across a tennis court, then fell down, landing on her hands. But she wasn''t hurt and jumped up, pumping her fists up and down, yelling "I did it! I did it!"<br/> <br/>It''s worth the falls. Don''t start the kid on clipless pedals quite yet, however.</td>', 'I expect the collective will not be terribly appreciative of this photo, but as a cyclist and a parent, it connects with me. When I taught my younger daughter to ride, she rolled across a tennis court, then fell down, landing on her hands. But she wasn''t hurt and jumped up, pumping her fists up and down, yelling "I did it! I did it!" It''s worth the falls. Don''t start the kid on clipless pedals quite yet, however.', '2014-06-07 14:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7225526, 1114590, 83313, '<td valign="top">Youngling of Grog goes on first hunt by self. Is grate coming of age test. Is youngest uv tribe, so Grog only expect small animul like deer or moose.</td>', 'Youngling of Grog goes on first hunt by self. Is grate coming of age test. Is youngest uv tribe, so Grog only expect small animul like deer or moose.', '2014-06-07 14:43:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7225528, 1115179, 172889, '<td valign="top">Oh no, decision to oomment on my lowest vote. I''ll probably be added to your wrath-list. The only thing that says Indians, is the cap, and it adds nothing to the image, could be just any cap shielding from the sun. The kid sucking the soother is way too old for it and is, in my opinion ugly. I mean the soother is ugly, not the kid. An expressionless face staring at the camera is boring. Hopefully you were targeting a low score, if not, then I''m sorry.</td>', 'Oh no, decision to oomment on my lowest vote. I''ll probably be added to your wrath-list. The only thing that says Indians, is the cap, and it adds nothing to the image, could be just any cap shielding from the sun. The kid sucking the soother is way too old for it and is, in my opinion ugly. I mean the soother is ugly, not the kid. An expressionless face staring at the camera is boring. Hopefully you were targeting a low score, if not, then I''m sorry.', '2014-06-07 14:47:58.000000', NULL, 1),
