(7225754, 1113689, 73056, '<td valign="top">Look who my neighbor is! Nice we both stayed above a 6. I didn''t vote, but I saw this browsing. Made me think of Nixter. Nicely done.</td>', 'Look who my neighbor is! Nice we both stayed above a 6. I didn''t vote, but I saw this browsing. Made me think of Nixter. Nicely done.', '2014-06-08 01:09:59.000000', NULL, 0),
