(7226154, 1115039, 19825, '<td valign="top">The lighting on this portrait is fantastic. I love the delicate tones on her face. While the makeup manufactures some drama, I might have liked the image even better without it. I assume this is artificial light, and, if so, you are getting better and better with it. Not that that fact should surprise anyone...</td>', 'The lighting on this portrait is fantastic. I love the delicate tones on her face. While the makeup manufactures some drama, I might have liked the image even better without it. I assume this is artificial light, and, if so, you are getting better and better with it. Not that that fact should surprise anyone...', '2014-06-09 10:23:28.000000', NULL, 0),
