(7229016, 1112560, 100831, '<td valign="top">I''m terribly sorry you took the comment personally, but I obviously didn''t know who the photographer was so I couldn''t possibly have been trying to offend.  I was referring only to the state of the environment, knowing scenes such as this one, will be changing pretty rapidly in the years to come. Your landscapes, such as this one, are always so beautiful.</td>', 'I''m terribly sorry you took the comment personally, but I obviously didn''t know who the photographer was so I couldn''t possibly have been trying to offend.  I was referring only to the state of the environment, knowing scenes such as this one, will be changing pretty rapidly in the years to come. Your landscapes, such as this one, are always so beautiful.', '2014-06-15 10:34:33.000000', NULL, 0),
